    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/a2d525725cf8135e550a0b77af8b0a53.avif?t=1720918725\" width=640 height=368 /></span><br><strong> Game description :</strong> This is a simulation game of managing a farm and planting crops, with totally randomized resource generation and various random gains. You will cultivate farmland, grow crops, mine minerals, smelt minerals, upgrade and make various tools here. But at the same time, you will also face a huge debt that is constantly increasing. You need to work hard to repay the debt. But don't worry, you can get more than 90 kinds of random gains, which will greatly help you increase your earning ability. During this process, you will also live with three cat girls, try to get their help, make friends with them, and explore their secrets!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Game Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/df4aeb5a78fc9fea1191ba27eafe3121.webp?t=1720918725\" width=48 height=48 /></span><strong> Rich resources, free to explore. </strong> You can freely explore here, collecting abundant resources and various minerals in the wild (refreshed once a week) to develop and operate the farm.<br></li><li> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/BeetRootSoup-export.png[/ img] [b] farming, to increase wealth. [/b] You can grow more than 20+ species of crops on your farm, fish more than 30+ species of fish on the river or sea, and further process these outputs for higher value returns.\n[*][img width=\"48\" height=\"48\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/5e7a0645004ee746cfaf7bad2827629a.webp?t=1720918725\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" width=48 height=48 /></span>[/img][b] Reasonable expansion and control of finances. [/b] Although you are carrying a large amount of debt, and the interest will continue to increase (as in reality :)), you can borrow to expand properly, use the borrowed funds to grow rapidly, quickly accumulate wealth, reduce your debt, avoid heavy interest, and eventually become a financial management master.\n[*][img width=\"48\" height=\"48\"][/img][b] Extract Buff, improve ability. [/b] You can spend a certain amount of money to obtain over 90+ buffs that will increase your ability to pay off debt to an incredible degree, such as reducing the growing time of crops, doubling the value of processed items, getting more fish when fishing, etc......\n[/list]\n[h2][u] Over 100 different kinds of food [/u][/h2]\n[img width=\"416\" height=\"224\"][/img]\n[h2][u] More than 20+ crops [/u][/h2]\n[img width=\"448\" height=\"288\"][/img]\n[img width=\"352\" height=\"352\"][/img]\n[h2][u] Over 30+ species of fish [/u][/h2]\n[img width=\"192\" height=\"192\"]<br></li><li><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/5e7a0645004ee746cfaf7bad2827629a.webp?t=1720918725\" width=48 height=48 /></span><strong> Reasonable expansion and control of finances. </strong> Although you are carrying a large amount of debt, and the interest will continue to increase (as in reality :)), you can borrow to expand properly, use the borrowed funds to grow rapidly, quickly accumulate wealth, reduce your debt, avoid heavy interest, and eventually become a financial management master.<br></li><li><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/34539542c8132a7d3e054c5f9dd89cee.webp?t=1720918725\" width=48 height=48 /></span><strong> Extract Buff, improve ability. </strong> You can spend a certain amount of money to obtain over 90+ buffs that will increase your ability to pay off debt to an incredible degree, such as reducing the growing time of crops, doubling the value of processed items, getting more fish when fishing, etc......</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u> Over 100 different kinds of food </u></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/d7ffdb695157daf66d398b541f75fd25.avif?t=1720918725\" width=416 height=224 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u> More than 20+ crops </u></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/3c520a00fda13203e34f0e1c2af2d046.avif?t=1720918725\" width=448 height=288 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/96191c299c592057aa71734d33ba76de.avif?t=1720918725\" width=352 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u> Over 30+ species of fish </u></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/9d89037dde404de0fda1b25bf9a9f6bb.avif?t=1720918725\" width=192 height=192 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Start your own farm and pay off your debts! </h2></strong><br>",
