ansion and control of finances. [/b] Although you are carrying a large amount of debt, and the interest will continue to increase (as in reality :)), you can borrow to expand properly, use the borrowed funds to grow rapidly, quickly accumulate wealth, reduce your debt, avoid heavy interest, and eventually become a financial management master.\n[*][img width=\"48\" height=\"48\"][/img][b] Extract Buff, improve ability. [/b] You can spend a certain amount of money to obtain over 90+ buffs that will increase your ability to pay off debt to an incredible degree, such as reducing the growing time of crops, doubling the value of processed items, getting more fish when fishing, etc......\n[/list]\n[h2][u] Over 100 different kinds of food [/u][/h2]\n[img width=\"416\" height=\"224\"][/img]\n[h2][u] More than 20+ crops [/u][/h2]\n[img width=\"448\" height=\"288\"][/img]\n[img width=\"352\" height=\"352\"][/img]\n[h2][u] Over 30+ species of fish [/u][/h2]\n[img width=\"192\" height=\"192\"]<br></li><li><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/5e7a0645004ee746cfaf7bad2827629a.webp?t=1720918725\" width=48 height=48 /></span><strong> Reasonable expansion and control of finances. </strong> Although you are carrying a large amount of debt, and the interest will continue to increase (as in reality :)), you can borrow to expand properly, use the borrowed funds to grow rapidly, quickly accumulate wealth, reduce your debt, avoid heavy interest, and eventually become a financial management master.<br></li><li><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730320/extras/34539542c8132a7d3e054c5f9dd89cee.webp?t=1720918725\" width=48 height=48 /></span><strong> Extract Buff, improve ability. </strong> You can spend a certain amount of money to obtain over 90+ buffs that will increase your ability to pay off debt to an in